{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25552","headline":"鹧鸪词二首 一 · 李涉","name":"鹧鸪词二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湘江烟水深，沙岸隔枫林。\n何处鹧鸪飞，日斜斑竹阴。\n二女空垂泪，三闾枉自沉。\n惟有鹧鸪啼，独伤行客心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李涉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25552.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25552","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}